{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6ae469ff-ec43-8961-8734-84b0d6a1c843",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T13:32:05-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mei Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:28:57-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:29:01-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good afternoon. My name is Mei Haddad. I'm calling about the drain at the corner by my house. It's all clogged up with leaves and the water just comes right into the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:29:13-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. Let me get that down. What's the address, Ms. Haddad?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:29:19-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "390 Callender Avenue. Up the North End. The catch basin is right at the corner there, maybe thirty feet from my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:29:27-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "390 Callender Avenue, North End, catch basin at the corner. And when did this happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:29:33-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, with the rain Friday and Saturday, three days ago now. It sat there all weekend. I went out Sunday and the whole mouth of the driveway was a pond, and the basin is just packed with leaves. Wet brown leaves, all matted down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:29:48-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, packed with leaves, water backing up into the driveway since the Friday and Saturday rain. Is it still standing there today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:29:56-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little, yes. It's gone down some but there's still a puddle, and every time a car goes by it splashes up on my steps. [pause] Sorry, my speaker on this phone is cracked, it buzzes when you get high. Can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:30:11-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. A little buzz now and then, but I've got you. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:30:17-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because I'll tell you, it was not this bad last winter. We had snow and rain and it drained right off. This year it's like nobody's looked at that basin at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:30:28-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds like it's been a headache. Has it been backing up other times this season too, or mostly this storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:30:35-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every time it rains hard it gets worse. This one was the worst. So what I want to know is, when did they last come by and clean it out? Because it doesn't look like anybody has in a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:30:49-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair question. I don't have the cleaning dates in front of me on this screen. I can put in a request for a crew to look at that basin and I'll note that you're asking when it was last serviced, so whoever picks it up can tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:31:05-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'd appreciate that. I'd rather have somebody tell me than keep wondering. I've been looking at that thing since Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:31:12-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me read it back. Catch basin at the corner by 390 Callender Avenue, clogged with leaves, water backing into your driveway after the Friday and Saturday rain, and you'd like to know when it was last cleaned. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:31:27-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. That's all of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:31:30-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Is 401-555-0197 the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:31:34-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the house phone. I'm here most of the day, so somebody can leave a message if I miss them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:31:41-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I'll send this to the crew supervisor today. They'll look at the basin as they can fit it in, and somebody should call you back with an answer on the last cleaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:31:52-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I hope it's soon, because there's more rain coming, they say, later in the week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:31:58-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll mark that in the note so they know. Thanks for calling, Ms. Haddad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T13:32:03-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Lorraine. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
